# az acr build's tar packer only respects `**/`-prefixed patterns
# (bare paths like `terraform/` are silently skipped). Everything below
# uses the `**/<name>/` form so it's applied universally.

# VCS / editor / OS
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store

# Whole subtrees not used by either image
**/contracts/
**/terraform/
**/audit/
**/audit_tasks/
**/docs/
**/tasks/
**/examples/

# mcp-meta web (deploys to Vercel separately) + tests
mcp-meta/web/
mcp-meta/test/

# Rust artifacts
**/target/

# Python artifacts
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/*.egg-info/

# Go compiled binaries (committed locally, shouldn't ship in source)
mcp-meta/mcp-meta
mcp-meta/adr-advocate
mcp-meta/adr-decision-maker
mcp-meta/adr-moderator
mcp-meta/adr-skeptic
mcp-meta/adr-writer
mcp-meta/pods/**/adr-advocate
mcp-meta/pods/**/adr-decision-maker
mcp-meta/pods/**/adr-moderator
mcp-meta/pods/**/adr-skeptic
mcp-meta/pods/**/adr-writer
mcp-meta/pods/**/hebbian
mcp-meta/pods/**/httpcli-pod
mcp-meta/pods/**/*-pod
drun/drun
drun/bin/
drun/sandbox.out
drun/vz.out
drun/coverage.out

# Node / Next.js (web is excluded above; keep these for any nested case)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/

# Terraform caches + state + plans + secret tfvars
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example

# Secrets — never ship into image context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env*.example
!**/.env*.template
scripts/*_keys.json
scripts/.image-tags

# Logs / temporary
**/*.log
**/.coverage*

# Docs (Markdown). Don't ship except top-level README + per-service if needed.
**/*.md
!README.md
!agent/README.md
!api/README.md
!mcp-meta/README.md
